Dialogue: 10,0:00:11.25,0:00:13.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Good thing it's sunny today, huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:14.13,0:00:15.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Ohto Ai.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:18.17,0:00:20.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Your clothes are cute.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:20.18,0:00:21.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Where do you shop?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:24.81,0:00:28.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Really, though, the weather is great.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:38.07,0:00:40.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't it hard to protect a lot of Eggs?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:41.33,0:00:42.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Is there a trick to it?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:43.91,0:00:45.62,Default,,0,0,0,,These snacks are really good.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:49.88,0:00:51.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Can I ask you a question, too?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:54.30,0:00:56.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course! Ask me anything!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:01.01,0:01:03.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you fighting for?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:04.55,0:01:06.72,Default,,0,0,0,,For Koito, of course!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:07.27,0:01:08.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's Koito?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:09.10,0:01:10.35,Default,,0,0,0,,My friend.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:11.39,0:01:12.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:13.98,0:01:16.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you sure it's not for yourself?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:16.94,0:01:18.26,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:19.16,0:01:22.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't like who you are now, so you go.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:22.41,0:01:24.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if you're scared.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:24.24,0:01:26.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You want to change the self you hate.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:26.99,0:01:28.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You too?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:29.12,0:01:32.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not like you. I love myself.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:33.12,0:01:34.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do you do it, then?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:36.38,0:01:37.59,Default,,0,0,0,,For my sister.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:38.25,0:01:39.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Your sister?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:39.34,0:01:40.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I let her die.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:17.10,0:03:18.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm home.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:22.99,0:03:23.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome home,
Dialogue: 10,0:03:24.66,0:03:25.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Ai.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:27.24,0:03:28.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Ohto,
Dialogue: 10,0:03:29.95,0:03:32.48,Default,,0,0,0,,do your injuries feel all right now?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:34.58,0:03:36.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Your mother is worried.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:36.67,0:03:40.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Won't you tell me what happened to you?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:43.34,0:03:44.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Ai!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:45.09,0:03:46.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Ma'am.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:46.47,0:03:48.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:49.84,0:03:52.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you hate me that much?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:54.22,0:03:55.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Not really.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:56.52,0:03:57.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't hate you.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:58.73,0:03:59.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm glad.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:01.06,0:04:03.40,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You can't say that!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:09.45,0:04:11.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's my contact info.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:12.41,0:04:14.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Message me when you want to change plans.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:14.66,0:04:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll buy Eggs on odd days; you buy them on even days.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:16.54,0:04:17.50,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:19.21,0:04:21.25,Default,,0,0,0,,We won't have to meet again.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:28.51,0:04:29.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Good luck.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:30.13,0:04:33.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't misuse my contact info.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:36.10,0:04:37.17,Default,,0,0,0,,As if.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:04.51,0:05:05.42,Default,,0,0,0,,So,
Dialogue: 10,0:05:05.97,0:05:09.55,Default,,0,0,0,,as long as I don't crack the Egg, nothing will happen.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:09.89,0:05:12.43,Default,,0,0,0,,They don't attack me, after all.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:46.50,0:05:47.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:47.67,0:05:49.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Umm...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:51.42,0:05:52.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, talk later!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:53.63,0:05:54.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:54.72,0:05:55.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Run!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:57.68,0:05:59.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Umm, what's going on?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:01.27,0:06:03.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this... a school?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:03.81,0:06:05.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, where are you going?!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:08.61,0:06:09.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Ow...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:13.36,0:06:13.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You okay?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:14.41,0:06:15.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:15.78,0:06:17.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll protect you!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:29.34,0:06:30.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:37.55,0:06:38.64,Default,,0,0,0,,This way!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:38.64,0:06:39.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Go in there!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:49.98,0:06:52.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I think that should buy us some time.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:53.19,0:06:55.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry to spring that on you. I'm—
Dialogue: 10,0:07:01.33,0:07:02.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:02.87,0:07:04.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Ohto Ai.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:05.00,0:07:07.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Suzuhara Minami.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:07.04,0:07:11.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry. I'll protect you to save Koito.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:11.92,0:07:13.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Koito?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:15.93,0:07:17.68,Default,,0,0,0,,She's your friend?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:18.68,0:07:19.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Yup.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:20.47,0:07:24.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm jealous. I wish I had friends.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:27.40,0:07:29.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?! Umm...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:30.98,0:07:33.48,Default,,0,0,0,,So, why a leotard?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:33.48,0:07:36.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Umm... I'm in the gymnastics club.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:36.95,0:07:38.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew it!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:38.07,0:07:40.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got a great figure. I'm jealous.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:42.87,0:07:47.21,Default,,0,0,0,,The coach was always yelling at me to maintain it.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:47.21,0:07:51.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a shut-in, so my legs are all puffy.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:51.42,0:07:53.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a shut-in?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:53.13,0:07:55.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Yup. I'm hopeless.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:57.38,0:07:58.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:58.63,0:07:59.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:59.43,0:08:02.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish I had your spirit and guts.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:02.76,0:08:04.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Wh-What do you mean?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:04.94,0:08:10.15,Default,,0,0,0,,One time, I made up my mind to skip morning practice.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:10.15,0:08:11.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:11.40,0:08:13.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanted to stay in bed.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:13.27,0:08:14.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I know that feeling.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:14.98,0:08:18.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanted to see what morning rush hour was like.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:18.78,0:08:20.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:20.20,0:08:24.24,Default,,0,0,0,,But, maybe because I psyched myself \Nup, I couldn't sleep all night.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:24.24,0:08:25.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:25.45,0:08:28.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Like when you wake up and it's already evening!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:28.00,0:08:32.33,Default,,0,0,0,,In the end, I went to morning practice without sleeping.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:32.33,0:08:34.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I was out of it from my all-nighter,
Dialogue: 10,0:08:34.88,0:08:38.34,Default,,0,0,0,,so the coach really let me have it.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:38.34,0:08:42.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I think that's way more impressive than anything I do.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:43.51,0:08:46.68,Default,,0,0,0,,If only I were strong like you, Ohto.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:48.43,0:08:49.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:49.81,0:08:52.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll protect you, so let's survive together.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:53.23,0:08:54.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:53.61,0:08:56.36,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,It will take more than that to bring your friend back.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:56.69,0:08:57.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:57.57,0:08:58.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:58.94,0:09:00.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's kind of...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:00.57,0:09:03.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Here I am. Over here.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:05.16,0:09:07.58,Default,,0,0,0,,To free the captured maiden,
Dialogue: 10,0:09:07.58,0:09:09.79,Default,,0,0,0,,you have to beat the Wonder Killer.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:10.25,0:09:12.42,Default,,0,0,0,,What does that mean?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:12.42,0:09:16.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought it would be easier \Nto understand if they had a name.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:16.30,0:09:18.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't we just have to survive?!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:18.84,0:09:23.59,Default,,0,0,0,,How is just running away supposed to solve anything?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:23.59,0:09:26.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Stand and fight, young lady!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:26.31,0:09:28.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Stand and fight what?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:28.47,0:09:32.65,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,A Wonder Killer is the form of an Egg's trauma.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:32.65,0:09:35.06,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,The two are drawn to each other.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:35.06,0:09:39.03,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,To take down a Wonder Killer, you need... your...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:39.03,0:09:40.44,Default,,0,0,0,,U-Umm...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:39.03,0:09:42.13,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,What? Hello?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:41.53,0:09:44.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I hear something from the other side of the...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:47.91,0:09:50.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that delinquent rubbing off on you?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:50.33,0:09:52.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I only took my eyes off you for a minute.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:53.33,0:09:54.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's this lady?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:54.83,0:09:58.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Practice. Don't slack off, Suzuhara.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:58.34,0:09:59.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Speak up!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:59.84,0:10:01.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Coach!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:01.76,0:10:03.09,Default,,0,0,0,,C-Coach?!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:03.88,0:10:05.51,Default,,0,0,0,,This is her trauma?!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:06.05,0:10:09.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean my teaching? Nonsense.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:10.06,0:10:12.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay away from Minami.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:12.23,0:10:13.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I'm really—
Dialogue: 10,0:10:13.39,0:10:14.15,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:14.69,0:10:16.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It's because I'm no good.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:16.90,0:10:17.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:17.48,0:10:20.94,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right. It's because you don't have enough spirit.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:21.44,0:10:23.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. I'll try harder.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:24.53,0:10:25.91,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:25.91,0:10:28.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Wasn't that so hard you couldn't take it?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:28.62,0:10:32.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Coach says she does it for me, because I'm gutless.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:36.88,0:10:37.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Mi...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:38.38,0:10:40.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Minami, get away from her!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:42.30,0:10:43.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:49.64,0:10:50.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Minami...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:51.56,0:10:53.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:54.69,0:10:56.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no. What happened?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:57.73,0:10:59.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Classic harassment.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:00.27,0:11:02.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would they do this to you?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:02.82,0:11:04.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Because you're my friend?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:04.40,0:11:05.89,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not it.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:06.74,0:11:09.75,Default,,0,0,0,,They say Mr. Sawaki is giving me special treatment.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:09.75,0:11:11.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I think they're jealous.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:12.20,0:11:14.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course he is. You're a transfer student.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:15.04,0:11:17.37,Default,,0,0,0,,A woman's jealousy sure is scary, huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:19.46,0:11:21.25,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't funny.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:23.21,0:11:25.22,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,Hey, this is wicked.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:25.22,0:11:27.05,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,Hey, face this way.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:27.05,0:11:27.89,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,Please stop.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:27.89,0:11:28.59,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:33.97,0:11:35.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:41.86,0:11:43.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you get the video?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:52.08,0:11:56.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. I was scared.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:56.08,0:11:58.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Scared of being left out.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:00.79,0:12:02.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You were scared, huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:02.59,0:12:03.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:03.67,0:12:05.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:05.01,0:12:06.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:06.26,0:12:08.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you tried your best.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:08.72,0:12:12.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:13.69,0:12:14.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:23.11,0:12:25.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel sorry for Minami.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:25.65,0:12:28.49,Default,,0,0,0,,What's so strong about you?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:28.90,0:12:30.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:31.78,0:12:32.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going
Dialogue: 10,0:12:33.74,0:12:34.87,Default,,0,0,0,,to change.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:41.67,0:12:44.42,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what's wrong with you.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:44.42,0:12:46.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Your figure changed on your period?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:46.34,0:12:48.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Take gymnastics seriously, damn it!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:48.84,0:12:51.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. Please forgive me.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:51.64,0:12:54.60,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,Just so you know, this isn't corporal punishment.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:54.60,0:12:58.39,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,It's tough love. I do it because I love you.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:59.18,0:13:01.19,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,Yes, Coach.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:03.94,0:13:06.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Once you're a good girl,
Dialogue: 10,0:13:06.40,0:13:09.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll make sure to finish you off painlessly.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:09.99,0:13:11.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:14.41,0:13:15.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Ohto?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:17.70,0:13:20.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough is enough, you old bitch!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:31.88,0:13:33.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:33.34,0:13:35.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my fault!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:35.55,0:13:37.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave me alone!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:37.56,0:13:42.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have enough spirit or guts, and I'm ugly and timid.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:42.39,0:13:44.23,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all my fault.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:44.23,0:13:45.43,Default,,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 10,0:13:46.40,0:13:46.95,Default,,0,0,0,,So—
Dialogue: 10,0:13:46.95,0:13:49.53,Default,,0,0,0,,You just want attention!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:49.53,0:13:54.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What you really mean is that you \Nwant someone to find you and love you!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:56.70,0:13:58.29,Default,,0,0,0,,So, I won't leave you alone!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:00.54,0:14:02.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I {\i1}can't {\i0}leave you alone!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:02.83,0:14:05.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep your mouth shut, brat!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:06.00,0:14:08.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up, bitch!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:11.88,0:14:14.43,Default,,0,0,0,,You're interrupting practice!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:19.39,0:14:21.27,Default,,0,0,0,,You annoying fly.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:22.64,0:14:24.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Please stop, Coach!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:25.44,0:14:27.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll do what you say!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:27.86,0:14:29.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll do anything!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:34.78,0:14:35.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Minami...
Dialogue: 10,0:14:48.29,0:14:50.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, for the love of...
Dialogue: 10,0:14:50.13,0:14:53.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You're all hopeless!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:55.38,0:14:56.64,Default,,0,0,0,,My ribbon.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:58.39,0:14:59.14,Default,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:59.56,0:15:00.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I can fight with this!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:00.93,0:15:02.88,Default,,0,0,0,,How do you like this, then?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:03.43,0:15:06.27,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this stuff? I can't see.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:06.94,0:15:08.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It's over.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:08.40,0:15:09.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Jump!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:13.49,0:15:14.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Dodge right!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:15.40,0:15:16.53,Default,,0,0,0,,She'll come from behind!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:21.37,0:15:23.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think you're doing?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:23.54,0:15:25.79,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,Are you disobeying me?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:25.79,0:15:27.54,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,Are you going to betray me?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:28.05,0:15:30.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Betray my tough love?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:31.13,0:15:33.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't know if you don't speak up!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:33.97,0:15:36.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Well? Are you going to disobey me?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:37.76,0:15:42.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Answer me, Suzuhara!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:42.10,0:15:44.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Here. I'm right here.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:50.31,0:15:51.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Stupid brats!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:51.98,0:15:55.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got clout with the association!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:55.82,0:15:57.86,Default,,0,0,0,,They even consult me
Dialogue: 10,0:15:57.86,0:15:59.78,Default,,0,0,0,,when they pick competitors!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:59.78,0:16:00.92,Default,,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 10,0:16:01.41,0:16:02.79,Default,,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 10,0:16:02.79,0:16:05.91,Default,,0,0,0,,So what, you asshole?!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:06.66,0:16:08.21,Default,,0,0,0,,It's tough love!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:08.21,0:16:08.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Dodge!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:11.29,0:16:17.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but that's just abuse!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:18.13,0:16:21.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I'm really mad!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:21.30,0:16:24.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye, Coach!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:37.49,0:16:38.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Minami!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:38.57,0:16:39.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:43.20,0:16:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Ai.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:46.62,0:16:49.16,Default,,0,0,0,,It's thanks to you and your ribbon.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:49.16,0:16:51.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You were really brave.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:52.42,0:16:53.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:53.63,0:16:57.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish I'd met you sooner, Ai.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:57.63,0:16:58.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:59.01,0:17:03.22,Default,,0,0,0,,If I had, we'd have chatted over \Nburgers and played games and things.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:03.85,0:17:06.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Like normal girls.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:06.89,0:17:07.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:13.52,0:17:16.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you remember me sometimes?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:17.23,0:17:18.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Minami?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:26.12,0:17:27.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:52.56,0:17:54.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Is one enough for you?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:56.52,0:17:58.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You're prudent, unlike Neiru.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:58.98,0:18:00.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Haste makes waste.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:00.99,0:18:03.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Did she die?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:03.16,0:18:04.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:05.74,0:18:09.54,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no point going to save \Nsomeone if she gets herself killed.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:11.62,0:18:13.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you know about it?!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:13.92,0:18:15.13,Default,,0,0,0,,It's her sister.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:15.13,0:18:17.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Neiru is going to save her little sister.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:17.88,0:18:20.38,Default,,0,0,0,,She wants to save her quickly.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:20.38,0:18:21.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder about that.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:21.97,0:18:24.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe she really wants to die, too.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:25.47,0:18:25.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:25.97,0:18:28.47,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why she's fearless.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:24.99,0:19:27.24,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:27.24,0:19:28.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, sorry.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:38.13,0:19:39.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you recovering okay?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:40.71,0:19:41.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:42.50,0:19:43.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm glad.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:45.76,0:19:48.51,Default,,0,0,0,,What would we do if we were friends?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:48.51,0:19:50.89,Default,,0,0,0,,We could go to a burger place.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:52.10,0:19:53.64,Default,,0,0,0,,And then what?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:55.85,0:19:59.07,Default,,0,0,0,,You and I would eat.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:59.07,0:20:01.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Fries, burgers, that kind of thing.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:01.69,0:20:05.94,Default,,0,0,0,,We'd both eat them together, at the same table.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:06.95,0:20:08.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that fun?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:11.83,0:20:13.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:13.87,0:20:14.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:16.04,0:20:17.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:25.01,0:20:27.05,Default,,0,0,0,,This smells amazing!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:30.05,0:20:30.97,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:31.64,0:20:32.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:45.78,0:20:47.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe once in a while.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:47.28,0:20:47.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 10,0:22:47.36,0:22:48.36,Default,,0,0,0,,To be continued.
